  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 5,000 gp (lesser), 10,000 gp (normal), 20,000 gp (greater)<br>\n<strong>Weight</strong> 5 lbs.; <strong>Feat Cost</strong> 1 sp</p>\n<p>When a creature fails a saving throw against a scarring talent, for the next 24 hours that creature takes a -2 penalty on saving throws against emotion and fear effects you create, and a -1 penalty on saving throws against other emotion and fear effects. Penalties from multiple scarring talents do not stack. This metamagic can be activated only for talents with the emotion or fear descriptor.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Apparatus, Scarring Spell; <strong>Cost</strong> 2,500 gp (lesser), 5,000 gp (normal), 10,000 gp (greater)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/apparatuses-metamagic#toc42\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": "<p>Selected profile: lesser tier; held slender rod. Use as part of casting a qualifying sphere effect while holding this apparatus in at least one hand. The effect must be caster level seven or lower. Spend one of 3 daily uses; only one metamagic apparatus may apply per casting. Its feat’s extra spell-point and casting-time costs are waived, but normal effect and other-metamagic costs still apply.</p><p>Only emotion/fear descriptors qualify, and the target must fail a save. For twenty-four hours its saves take -2 against the user’s emotion/fear effects and -1 against other emotion/fear effects. Multiple scarring penalties do not stack.</p><p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/apparatuses-metamagic\">Shared metamagic apparatus rules</a>. Feat Cost applies to taking the feat, not using the physical apparatus.</p>",
      "unidentified": ""
    },
